  "problem": "Evaluate the following matrix product:\n\n|  | $3$ | $0$ | $0$ |  |  |  | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |  |  |  | $0$ | {{field-1}} | $6$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-1$ | $2$ | $4$ |  |  |  | $3$ | $-2$ | $0$ |  | $=$ |  | $10$ | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |\n|  | $0$ | $5$ | $-2$ |  |  |  | $1$ | $0$ | $3$ |  |  |  | {{field-4}} | {{field-5}} | $-6$ |  |",
